{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-49","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：二项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"To find the second binomial straight line.","book":10,"number":49,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":49,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","contentId":"euclid-10-49","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d04e926a87b5a2c4effb6c33a6294a5070aeed2bdabadab578f748353757edf","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-49.statement","euclid-10-49.construction.1","euclid-10-49.construction.2","euclid-10-49.proof.1","euclid-10-49.proof.2","euclid-10-49.proof.3","euclid-10-49.proof.4","euclid-10-49.proof.5","euclid-10-49.construction.3","euclid-10-49.proof.6","euclid-10-49.proof.7","euclid-10-49.proof.8","euclid-10-49.conclusion","euclid-10-49.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-49.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"660c2ee9d452cf593ea6abd7fb03857b041cfdca4e676a2b6ebe9f19e8b8947e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the second binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到第二条二项无理线段直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"60a5f0a766c6fa831890136d1b2782b0240b25ed6f810a44ecc0157d285c9ba9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers AC, CB be set out such that the sum of them AB has to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number, but has not to AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; let a rational straight line D be set out, and let EF be commensurable in length with D; therefore EF is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出两个数字AC,CB,AB和BC,即平方数和平方数的比,但平方数和平方数的比没有达到AC;有理线段和D的比,EF和D的比为长度可公度;因此,EF和有理的比为有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ade70fdb401c6a7f7c9b263ceb53c72a947f1520902910a19b472eb97ef294c3","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived then that, as the number CA is to AB, so also is the square on EF to the square on FG; [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore the square on EF is commensurable with the square on FG. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设CA是AB,EF是正方形是FG,EF是正方形是正方形,FG是正方形是可公度。 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a21c80b941708986e586273b5cffef0cafa7e95db544551ab50ba33960aa4a0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc28c3e313cd500bf94425e30df9cab0c7ad71092fe2fe905e7abbadc22c7b20","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the number CA has not to AB the ratio which a square number has to a square number, neither has the square on EF to the square on FG the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于CA的数值还没有达到平方数的数值与平方数的数值之比的AB,FG的数值与正方形的数值之比的平方数与平方数的数值之比的也还没有达到平方数。（相关点与线段：EF）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fad1473d7a5e66e27085822e4ca4ad36f7ad498bf7e657afc1337466e0862fcf","citations":["euclid-10-9","euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EF is incommensurable in length with FG; [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] therefore EF, FG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore EG is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF的长度为不可公度,FG的长度为FG;EF的长度为有理线段的长度为平方可公度而长度不可公度;EG的长度为二项无理线段。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba644d5bfba5710b0263d1ad8919704ddaa98f3f62334aeee300c1d13b164777","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is next to be proved that it is also a second binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一步是证明它也是第二条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c335b774300b59540037e8cb6b10b7d2fb33f2902b2689dec64d06400106c1b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, inversely, as the number BA is to AC, so is the square on GF to the square on FE, while BA is greater than AC, therefore the square on GF is greater than the square on FE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"反过来,BA对AC的比等于GF对BA对正方形的比,FE对FE对正方形的比,BA对AC的比则大于AC,因此GF对正方形的比大于FE对正方形的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0767402f6a53d5db77866cf98ca39c352ec759ebdb27120b3668d1b51cf8ed31","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the squares on EF, H be equal to the square on GF; therefore, convertendo, as AB is to BC, so is the square on FG to the square on H. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF,H,正方形等于GF,正方形;因此,转换率为AB,BC,相当于FG,正方形,H；上述对应量具有相同的比例关系。 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d1ec6a9a726afff4f401f08dbe33d73217a988e7e010c721f003729358bd0bd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB has to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore the square on FG also has to the square on H the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB比平方数比平方数比平方数,FG比正方形比正方形比H比平方数比平方数比平方数。（相关点与线段：BC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a5cc558adcfcc4e7f73d5fc4944074b9a774df94207797d70f5d60913e8a5e43","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FG is commensurable in length with H; [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] so that the square on FG is greater than the square on FE by the square on a straight line commensurable with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG是长度可公度,H;因此,FG的正方形比FE的正方形大于正方形,直线为可公度,直线为FG。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2439deaf2e894613635202a056e70a5d4ddb6a933cc5c02924c550585c1efeb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FG, FE are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, and EF, the lesser term, is commensurable in length with the rational straight line D set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG,FE是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,EF, 较轻的时期是长度可公度, 设定了有理线段 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27cfd37ac0c01a09206cdef9918535753eb59dbdbfb397508b8f659d68440266","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EG is a second binomial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EG是第二二项无理线段直线,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-49.source","contentId":"euclid-10-49","revisionId":"euclid-10-49@raw-8d04e926a87b5a2c","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a166389bf72e78aeaaa36fb4a0095e99c331c760f4c3e76d6fb24954a688a72e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-49:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-49","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-49.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49/","sourceLabel":"X. 6, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-49:euclid-10-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-49","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-49.proof.3","euclid-10-49.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49/","sourceLabel":"X. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-49:euclid-10-36:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-49","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-49.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-36","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49/","sourceLabel":"X. 36"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-49:euclid-5-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-49","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-49.construction.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.49/","sourceLabel":"V. 19, Por."}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-49:euclid-10-6:explicit","id":"euclid-10-6","book":10,"number":6,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-49:euclid-10-9:explicit","id":"euclid-10-9","book":10,"number":9,"kind":"proposition","title":"长度可公度与平方数比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-49:euclid-10-36:explicit","id":"euclid-10-36","book":10,"number":36,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与二项无理线段与无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-49:euclid-5-19:explicit","id":"euclid-5-19","book":5,"number":19,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustrat